\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-315\li315\sl200\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par  1.\cf0    Do you know the song that the angels sang
\par \pard\li315\sl200\slmult0\qj On the night in the long ago
\par When the heavens above with their music rang
\par Till it echoed in the earth below?
\par 
\par \pard\li315\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par \pard\li315\sl200\slmult0\qj\i0 All glory in the highest, peace on earth,
\par Goodwill to men. Glory, glory in the highest!
\par In the highest! Glory, glory;
\par Glory in the highest, glory in the highest;
\par Peace on earth, goodwill to men!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-315\li315\sl200\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.   Do you know the story that the shepherds heard
\par \pard\li315\sl200\slmult0\qj As they watched all their flocks by night
\par \pard\li315\sl200\slmult0 When the skies bent down and the  heaven stirred
\par By the voices of the angels bright?
\par All glory in the highest.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par \pard\li315\sl200\slmult0\qj\i0 All glory in the highest, peace on earth,
\par Goodwill to men. Glory, glory in the highest!
\par In the highest! Glory, glory;
\par Glory in the highest, glory in the highest;
\par Peace on earth, goodwill to men!
\par \pard\li315\sl200\slmult0 
\par \pard\fi-315\li315\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.    Do you know the story that the Wise Men heard
\par \pard\li315\sl200\slmult0 As they journeyed from the east afar
\par O'er the pathway plain for their night  burned
\par In their sight a glorious guiding star?
\par \pard       All glory in the highest. 
\par 
\par \pard\li315\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par \pard\li315\sl200\slmult0\qj\i0 All glory in the highest, peace on earth,
\par Goodwill to men. Glory, glory in the highest!
\par In the highest! Glory, glory;
\par Glory in the highest, glory in the highest;
\par Peace on earth, goodwill to men!\cf1\ul\b\f1 
\par }

